  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Emergency Maintenance Log
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Emergency Maintenance Log
  content: 'Maintenance Log 04-17

    Cooling systems continue operating within
    acceptable ranges, yet pressure readings increase every shift.

    Overflow
    residue has begun crystallizing around several valves.

    Workers report hearing
    running water beneath the factory floor where no pipes are installed.

    Engineering
    recommends an immediate shutdown.

    Management has declined, citing production
    quotas.'
